date-released: "2026-11-16"
keywords:
  - soil organic carbon
  - geostatistics
  - kriging
  - Bayesian kriging
  - block kriging
  - REML
  - uncertainty quantification
  - sampling design
  - quantile regression forest
  - digital soil mapping
  - positional error
